  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Food Systems Resilience in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance the resilience and sustainability of food systems in Jordan and Kenya by addressing the intertwined challenges of humanitarian needs, peacebuilding, and development. It will benefit from the collaboration between the UNDP Food and Agriculture Commodity Systems (FACS) team within BPPS and the CB Disaster Risk Reduction and Recovery for Building Resilience (DRT), together with the UNDP Resilience Hub for Africa in Nairobi. This partnership will combine FACSs expertise</narrative>
  </description>
